# Labels whose line legitimately DIFFERS from tests/testmadcide_chthonic.win64_expect
# versus tests/testmadcide_chthonic.expect — the win64 domain's own answers: the
# REPL session backend forks the running madc and Windows has no fork yet
# (plan 41.9a; the Windows REPL backend is the chthonic product release), so
# no session runs, F5 runs nothing and the Variables view stays empty. Every
# other labelled line must be identical in both (scripts/check-expect-twins.sh).
chthonic-repl
variables-f5
variables-goto
variables-entry
variables-lib-f5
variables-lib-goto
variables-lib-entry
